From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:15:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: say which 'mill-turn' the guide means (live tooling,
 not turning on a mill)

Add a two-meanings box to the turning operations page and the Mill-turn
section of Machine types, a 'Turning on a mill' glossary entry, and the
two meanings on the camcraft-mcp skill's load_machine row. Qualify each
other bare 'mill-turn' in the guide and the README.

Fixes #2581

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
